{"seq":1,"slug":"pipeline-dag-component-lifecycle","title":"管道 DAG 与组件生命周期模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/opentelemetry-collector-pipeline-internals-otlp/collector-architecture-component/pipeline-dag-component-lifecycle","wordCount":2425,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"管道-dag-与组件生命周期模型\">管道 DAG 与组件生命周期模型</h1><p>一个 trace 从 SDK 发出、经 agent Collector 的 <code>otlp</code> receiver 收下、穿过 memory_limiter 和 batch，最后被 fan-out 成两份分别送往 Jaeger 与 Tempo——这条路径在配置里只是几行 YAML，但在进程内存里它是一张<strong>有向无环图</strong>：节点是 receiver / processor / exporter / connector 的实例，边是数据的流向。理解这张图怎么被构建、每个节点在什么时机被创建、启动、关闭，是排查「配置写对了但数据没到」「关停时丢了一批 span」这类问题的前提。本文从 <code>service.pipelines</code> 这段唯一的激活配置出发，讲清 Collector 内部 <code>service/internal/graph</code> 包的构建流程、<code>component.Component</code> 生命周期契约、connector 如何跨管道连边，以及能力协商如何决定数据拷贝。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-pipeline-是图-component-是节点\">核心概念：pipeline 是图，component 是节点</h2><p>OpenTelemetry 官方架构文档把 pipeline 定义为「数据在 Collector 中遵循的一条路径」，从接收、处理到导出（来源：opentelemetry.io/docs/collector/architecture/，2026-10 核对）。一个 pipeline 绑定单一信号类型（traces / metrics / logs，profiles 在开发中），声明如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"service:&#10;  pipelines:&#10;    traces:&#10;      receivers: [otlp]&#10;      processors: [memory_limiter, batch]&#10;      exporters: [otlp/jaeger, otlp/tempo]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pipelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    traces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">memory_limiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp/jaeger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp/tempo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>顶层 <code>receivers:</code> / <code>processors:</code> / <code>exporters:</code> / <code>connectors:</code> 块只<strong>定义可用组件</strong>，不激活任何东西。组件只有在被某个 <code>service</code> 段落引用时才实例化——官方配置文档的措辞是「A component defined in a top-level block is active only when referenced from the appropriate <code>service</code> section」（来源：opentelemetry.io/docs/collector/configuration/）。组件标识统一用 <code>type[/name]</code> 复合键，如 <code>otlp</code> 或 <code>otlp/2</code>，<code>name</code> 段让同类型的多份配置并存。</p>\n<p>从图论角度看，单个 pipeline 内部是<strong>线性处理器链</strong>，两端各有一个扇入 / 扇出点；不同 pipeline 通过共享 receiver/exporter（或经 connector）被串成一张更宽的图。四类可运行组件（<code>component.Kind</code>）的分工如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  R1[receiver otlp] --&gt; FI[capabilitiesNode&lt;br/&gt;扇入 capabilityconsumer]&#10;  R2[receiver otlp/2] --&gt; FI&#10;  FI --&gt; P1[processor memory_limiter]&#10;  P1 --&gt; P2[processor batch]&#10;  P2 --&gt; FO[fanOutNode&lt;br/&gt;fanoutconsumer]&#10;  FO --&gt; X1[exporter otlp/jaeger]&#10;  FO --&gt; X2[exporter otlp/tempo]&#10;  FO --&gt; C1[connector count]&#10;  C1 --&gt; FI2[下游 pipeline 的 fan-in]\">flowchart TD\n  R1[receiver otlp] --&gt; FI[capabilitiesNode&lt;br/&gt;扇入 capabilityconsumer]\n  R2[receiver otlp/2] --&gt; FI\n  FI --&gt; P1[processor memory_limiter]\n  P1 --&gt; P2[processor batch]\n  P2 --&gt; FO[fanOutNode&lt;br/&gt;fanoutconsumer]\n  FO --&gt; X1[exporter otlp/jaeger]\n  FO --&gt; X2[exporter otlp/tempo]\n  FO --&gt; C1[connector count]\n  C1 --&gt; FI2[下游 pipeline 的 fan-in]</pre><p>四类可运行组件（<code>component.Kind</code>）的分工与生命周期特性如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Kind</th>\n<th>处理信号</th>\n<th>在图中位置</th>\n<th>跨管道共享实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Receiver</td>\n<td>生产数据</td>\n<td>每 pipeline 的入边起点</td>\n<td>同名 receiver 全进程只创建 1 个实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Processor</td>\n<td>变换数据</td>\n<td>扇入点到扇出点之间的链</td>\n<td>同名 processor 在不同 pipeline 中<strong>各建独立实例</strong>，状态不共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Exporter</td>\n<td>消费数据</td>\n<td>扇出点的出边终点</td>\n<td>同名 exporter 可被多 pipeline 复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Connector</td>\n<td>既是 exporter 又是 receiver</td>\n<td>连接两条 pipeline 的边</td>\n<td>每对 (输入信号, 输出信号) 一个实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Extension（第 5 类）</td>\n<td>不碰遥测数据</td>\n<td>图之外，进程级服务</td>\n<td>全局单例，如 health_check、zpages</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个关键的非直觉点：<strong>复用 processor 名字不等于复用状态</strong>。官方架构文档明确写道，同一 processor 出现在两个 pipeline 中会创建两份实例、各自持有独立状态，即使配置文本完全相同。另外，从 receiver 经扇出到各下游是<strong>同步函数调用</strong>，一个被阻塞的 processor 会拖住挂在同一 receiver 上的其他 pipeline，并让该 receiver 停止转发——这是 agent 模式里单一 <code>otlp</code> receiver 喂多个 pipeline 时最易被忽视的耦合点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"graph-build-的三阶段构建\">graph.Build 的三阶段构建</h2><p><code>graph.Build</code>（源码 <code>service/internal/graph/graph.go</code>，Apache-2.0，The OpenTelemetry Authors）在 Collector 启动时被 <code>service</code> 包调用，产出内部持有 gonum <code>simple.DirectedGraph</code> 的 <code>Graph</code>。构建分三阶段：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>createNodes</strong> — 遍历每个 pipeline 配置的 receivers / processors / exporters 列表，逐一创建对应的节点类型。跨 pipeline 共享的 receiver/exporter 会<strong>复用同一个节点</strong>，并把 pipeline 成员信息合并进它的 <code>InstanceID</code>；processor 则按 pipeline 独立建节点。</li>\n<li><strong>createEdges</strong> — 在每个 pipeline 内部连边：所有 receiver 指向该 pipeline 的扇入节点 <code>capabilitiesNode</code>，该节点按配置顺序串起 processor 链，链尾接扇出节点 <code>fanOutNode</code>，扇出节点再指向全部 exporter。即使只有一个 exporter，扇出节点也照常存在，此时它等价于透传。</li>\n<li><strong>buildComponents</strong> — 对图做拓扑排序（<code>topo.Sort</code>），然后<strong>逆序</strong>遍历：先实例化下游组件，再把它作为 <code>next</code> consumer 交给上游组件。所以 exporter 比它上游的 processor 先被创建，processor 又比 receiver 先被创建——这正是 connector 能在其工厂方法里直接拿到下游消费端的原因。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>设一个 pipeline 有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 个 receiver、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 个 processor、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 个 exporter，其内部连边数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>pipe</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{pipe}} = R + P + X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pipe</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>（扇入点前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 条、processor 链 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 条、扇出点后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 条）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 条 pipeline 通过 connector 串接时，整图边数在各 pipeline 求和之上再加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 条跨管道边。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组件生命周期-创建-start-shutdown\">组件生命周期：创建、Start、Shutdown</h2><p><code>component.Component</code> 接口被刻意压到最小——只有两个方法（源码 <code>component/component.go</code>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"Start(ctx context.Context, host component.Host) error&#10;Shutdown(ctx context.Context) error\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx context.Context, host component.Host) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Shutdown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx context.Context) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span></span></code></pre></div><p>生命周期是「工厂创建 → Start → 运行 → Shutdown」的单向流程，同一实例<strong>不会重新启动</strong>。几条硬性约定直接决定线上行为：Start 返回错误会<strong>中止整个 Collector 启动</strong>；长跑任务应基于 <code>context.Background()</code> 自建可取消 context，而非持有启动 context（官方注释说明它当前持续整个进程生命周期，但未来可能引入启动超时）；Shutdown 必须<strong>幂等</strong>——即便 Start 从未被调用或已关闭过也要安全返回，返回前停止后台操作、冲刷缓冲区、不再接受新数据；之后该实例上不会再有任何方法被调用。</p>\n<p><code>service/service.go</code> 的启动顺序分三层：<code>Service.Start</code> 先 <code>ServiceExtensions.Start</code> 启动扩展，再 <code>Pipelines.StartAll</code> 启动管道，最后 <code>NotifyPipelineReady</code> 通知扩展「管道已就绪」。关闭<strong>完全逆序</strong>：<code>NotifyPipelineNotReady</code>、<code>Pipelines.ShutdownAll</code>、关闭扩展，最后按创建逆序关闭 tracer / meter / logger provider。这个不对称是刻意的——健康检查、zpages 需在管道存活期间可观测，而文件存储类扩展又必须活到管道把缓冲刷完。</p>\n<h2 id=\"connector-跨越两条管道的边\">Connector：跨越两条管道的边</h2><p>Connector 是图模型里最特殊的一类组件。官方配置文档的定义浓缩成一句：「Connectors join two pipelines, acting as both exporter and receiver」。在<strong>上游 pipeline</strong> 的 <code>exporters</code> 列表里出现时它扮演 exporter，消费该 pipeline 输出的数据；在<strong>下游 pipeline</strong> 的 <code>receivers</code> 列表里出现时它扮演 receiver，向下游投递。两端信号类型可相同也可不同，这正是它做信号转换（如 trace → metric）的能力来源。</p>\n<p><code>connector/connector.go</code> 定义三种输入接口 <code>Traces</code> / <code>Metrics</code> / <code>Logs</code>，每个都组合 <code>component.Component</code> 与对应的 <code>consumer.*</code> 接口。工厂通过 <code>NewFactory</code> + <code>WithTracesToMetrics</code> 这类选项注册「信号对」，未注册的信号对创建时返回 <code>internal.ErrDataTypes</code>。官方经典例子是 <code>count</code> connector——消费 traces、产出 metrics：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"connectors:&#10;  count: {}&#10;service:&#10;  pipelines:&#10;    traces: { receivers: [otlp], exporters: [count] } # 消费 traces&#10;    metrics: { receivers: [count], exporters: [prometheus] } # 产出 metrics\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">connectors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pipelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    traces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] } </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 消费 traces</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] } </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 产出 metrics</span></span></code></pre></div><p>图构建阶段对 connector 做额外校验：对 exporter 侧与 receiver 侧信号的每种组合查询 <code>connectorStability</code>，某信号对不受支持即报错——<strong>connector 不能只出现在一侧</strong>。每对受支持的信号创建一个 connector 节点，同时注册为输入 pipeline 的 exporter 与输出 pipeline 的 receiver，物理上卡在「上游扇出节点」与「下游扇入节点」之间。因为 connector 可以构成环，配置里能写出循环引用。图构建用 <code>topo.Sort</code> 检测，遇 <code>Unorderable</code> 就调用 <code>cycleErr</code> 提取有向环：保留第一个环、去重端点、旋转到以 connector 开头（环必含至少一个 connector），格式化成一条串起所涉 processor 与 connector 的错误消息，按链条逐段核对 <code>service.pipelines</code> 即可定位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"能力协商-mutatesdata-与扇出克隆\">能力协商：MutatesData 与扇出克隆</h2><p><code>capabilitiesNode</code>（扇入点）承担数据所有权的核心职责：<code>buildComponents</code> 阶段它汇总扇出消费端与链上每个 processor 的 <code>MutatesData</code> 能力，再通过 <code>capabilityconsumer</code> 包装 <code>next</code> consumer 交给 receiver，使 receiver 投递前就知道下游是否可能就地改写数据，从而决定要不要先克隆。</p>\n<p>扇出端由 <code>fanoutconsumer</code> 实现（源码 <code>internal/fanoutconsumer/</code>）。以 logs 为例，<code>NewLogs</code> 把多个 consumer 包成一个，并做了关键优化：若只有一个 consumer 且它不变更数据，直接原样返回，零开销。否则分成 <strong>mutable</strong>（可能改写数据）与 <strong>readonly</strong>（承诺不改写）两类。</p>\n<p><code>ConsumeLogs</code> 的拷贝规则是这个设计的精髓：每个 mutable consumer（最后一个除外）收到一份 <code>plog.Logs</code> 克隆；最后一个 mutable consumer 只有在「无任何 readonly consumer 且数据未标记只读」时才拿到原始对象，否则也收到克隆。readonly consumer 之间共享同一份数据，超过一个时投递前先把数据标记为只读。所有 consumer 的返回错误用 <code>multierr</code> 合并。</p>\n<p>把这条规则代入最坏情况：扇出点挂 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个 mutable consumer、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 个 readonly consumer，同一次投递产生的对象份数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\begin{cases} m, &amp; r = 0 \\\\ m + 1, &amp; r &gt; 0 \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即「每个改写者一份，只读者共享一份，且只要存在只读者，最后一个改写者也不能独占原件」。这解释了为什么在一条 exporter 链上堆多个会改数据的 processor 会显著抬高内存——每多一个改写者就多一次全量克隆，payload 越大、GC 压力越明显。对内存敏感的场景应尽量让下游保持只读，或用 <code>memory_limiter</code> 作为 pipeline 的第一个 processor 兜底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>service.pipelines</code> 是<strong>唯一激活点</strong>：顶层组件块只是定义，未被引用就不会实例化；标识格式为 <code>type[/name]</code>。</li>\n<li><code>graph.Build</code> 分三阶段：createNodes（建节点、跨 pipeline 复用 receiver/exporter 实例）、createEdges（连扇入 / processor 链 / 扇出）、buildComponents（拓扑排序后逆序实例化，下游先于上游）。单 pipeline 连边数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R + P + X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>生命周期契约只有 <code>Start</code> / <code>Shutdown</code>：Start 出错即中止进程启动；Shutdown 必须幂等、冲刷缓冲、停后台任务；实例不可重启。</li>\n<li>启动顺序为「扩展 → 管道」，关闭完全逆序，保证扩展在管道存活期可观测、在数据刷完后才退出。</li>\n<li>Connector 同时充当 exporter 与 receiver 连接两条 pipeline，且必须双侧出现；配置成环会被 <code>topo.Sort</code> + <code>cycleErr</code> 检出并给出可读链条。</li>\n<li><code>capabilitiesNode</code> 聚合 <code>MutatesData</code> 决定是否克隆，<code>fanoutconsumer</code> 按 mutable / readonly 分流拷贝——改写者越多，同一次投递的克隆份数越多，这是内存放大的着力点。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>信号的具体承载格式（protobuf 结构、传输与编码协商）见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../otlp-protocol-data-model/otlp-transport-grpc-http-encoding\">OTLP 传输层：gRPC / HTTP 与编码协商</a>；processor 与自定义扩展的构建细节见本 hub 第三章「处理、扩展与自定义组件」。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"管道 DAG 与组件生命周期模型","id":"管道-dag-与组件生命周期模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：pipeline 是图，component 是节点","id":"核心概念-pipeline-是图-component-是节点"},{"level":2,"text":"graph.Build 的三阶段构建","id":"graph-build-的三阶段构建"},{"level":2,"text":"组件生命周期：创建、Start、Shutdown","id":"组件生命周期-创建-start-shutdown"},{"level":2,"text":"Connector：跨越两条管道的边","id":"connector-跨越两条管道的边"},{"level":2,"text":"能力协商：MutatesData 与扇出克隆","id":"能力协商-mutatesdata-与扇出克隆"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"Collector 组件角色：receiver / processor / exporter / connector 与数据流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/opentelemetry-collector-pipeline-internals-otlp/collector-architecture-component/receiver-processor-exporter-connector-roles"}}